Aim

To develop an online library management system for managing books, issuing and returning books, and calculating fines.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for books and study materials.
Admin adds, updates, or deletes books.
Issue books to students and update return status.
Calculate fines for overdue books.
Users view borrowing history, fines, and download materials.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online library management system was designed to manage books, student records, book issuing and returning, and fine calculations efficiently.
